{"id":"u_ber","lemma":"über","pos":"prep","rank":86,"glosses":["[with accusative or dative] above, over (spatially)","[with accusative] about, concerning, over, at (in reference to)","[with accusative] via, through, by way of"],"ipa":"/ˈyːbɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4c/De-%C3%BCber2.ogg/De-%C3%BCber2.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Lachen Sie über mich?","en":"Are you laughing at me?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755368","words":[{"g":"to laugh"},{"g":"she / they / you"},null,{"g":"me","l":"ich"}]},{"text":"Was denkst du über diese Leute?","en":"What do you think of these people?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/593253","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to think","l":"denken"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"people"}]},{"text":"Ich will mehr über dich wissen.","en":"I want to know about you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/700431","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"more"},null,{"g":"you","l":"du"},{"g":"to know"}]},{"text":"Was willst du über mich wissen?","en":"What do you want to know about me?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to know"}]},{"text":"Er wohnt über mir.","en":"He lives above me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394678","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to live, reside, dwell","l":"wohnen"},null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"}]}]}